0 102 533 [
[(In the quartic example, for both the amplitude and the frequency, we)]
[(have to take the fourth root of the target value \050which we get by)]
[(taking square root twice.\051 Then we raise the [line~] output to the)]
[(fourth power by squaring twice \050the [*~] objects, whose left and)]
[(right inlets are the same.\051 The cost is mostly that of the four)]
[(additional [*~] objects.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
